# Zoom Meeting SDK Integration Plan — InternFirst

## Context

InternFirst already has a fully-wired interview scheduling system (Phase 1): DB table, state machine, Supabase helpers, modals, banners. This plan adds Phase 2 — in-platform video calls via the Zoom Meeting SDK component view, so interviews happen inside the InternFirst dashboard with the site chrome preserved. No external Zoom links are ever shown to users.

Key constraint: Zoom API secrets (for creating/deleting meetings and generating SDK signatures) must never touch the client. This drives the introduction of three API routes.

