## Phase 3 — Server-side Zoom Helpers

**New file:** `app/src/lib/zoom.ts`

```
zoom.ts exports:
  getZoomAccessToken()          → Bearer token via Server-to-Server OAuth
  createZoomMeeting(opts)       → POST /v2/users/me/meetings → { id, join_url }
  deleteZoomMeeting(meetingId)  → DELETE /v2/meetings/{id}
  getZoomZak()                  → GET /v2/users/me/token?type=zak (for host join)
  generateSdkSignature(mn, role) → HMAC-SHA256 JWT for Meeting SDK
```

- `getZoomAccessToken` caches the token in a module-level variable with expiry check (tokens last 1 hour)
- `generateSdkSignature`: standard Zoom SDK JWT — `{sdkKey, mn, role, iat, exp, tokenExp}` signed with HMAC-SHA256 using `ZOOM_SDK_SECRET`. Use Node's built-in `crypto` module (no extra dep).
- All functions throw on error — callers wrap in try/catch.

