## Flow Diagram

```
Student accepts interview
        │
        ▼
POST /api/interviews/respond
        │
        ├─ Zoom REST API: create meeting ──► zoom_meeting_id, zoom_join_url
        │
        └─ Supabase: status='accepted', store zoom fields
                │
                ▼
        Student/Employer see "Join Interview" button
        (enabled 10 min before scheduled_at)
                │
                ▼
        /dashboard/{role}/interviews/[id]
                │
                ▼
        POST /api/interviews/zoom-signature
                │
                └─ Returns: signature, sdkKey, meetingNumber, zak?
                        │
                        ▼
                <ZoomMeetingRoom /> renders embedded Zoom
                        │
                        ▼
                On leave → if past scheduled_at:
                POST /api/interviews/complete → status='completed'
                Redirect to dashboard

Employer/Student cancels
        │
        ▼
POST /api/interviews/cancel
        │
        ├─ Zoom REST API: delete meeting (fire-and-forget on 404)
        └─ Supabase: status='cancelled'
```

